<title>USA: Hercules Inc Q1 shr increasees.</title>
<headline>Hercules Inc Q1 shr increasees.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.05		    $0.70</p>
<p> Net			107,989		   76,148</p>
<p> Sales		    495,153		  502,570</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 102,800		  109,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q1 was $0.66 per share.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 includes a gain of $2.10 per share, including $2.04 per share from the sale of its 50-50 stake in the Tastemaker venture, and a $1.74 per share charge for rationalization for assets, related costs, income taxes, legal settlements and accruals for environmental remediation.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
